# Unfulfilled Acceptance Criteria — Prioritized Attack Plan

## Audit Summary

Across **6 user story files**, there are **8 fulfilled** and **50 unfulfilled** acceptance criteria. Below is the full breakdown by feasibility tier, followed by the proposed implementation batch.

---

## Tier Classification

### 🟢 Tier 1: Implementable Now (Within our NestJS + Next.js stack)

These require no external API keys, hardware, or mobile-native capabilities. They can be built with our existing database schema, backend services, and frontend.

| # | File | Story | Criterion | Approach |
|---|------|-------|-----------|----------|
| 1 | `tenant-portal-web` | 2.1 — PM Command Center | Daily "Action Item" list driven by ML | Cron job aggregating lease expirations, overdue maintenance, delinquencies into `ActionIntents` |
| 2 | `tenant-portal-web` | 2.1 — PM Command Center | Financial alerts for OPEX deviations | Compare current month expenses against trailing 12-month average; emit `OPEX_ANOMALY_INTENT` |
| 3 | `tenant-portal-web` | 2.1 — PM Command Center | Portfolio heatmap for financial health / occupancy / sentiment | Frontend component reading property-level aggregates + a new API endpoint |
| 4 | `tenant-portal-web` | 2.2 — Messaging | Auto-translation of messages | Add language detection + translation stub to `SentimentAnalysisService` |
| 5 | `rent-optimization-ml` | 1.1 — Dynamic Lease Pricing | Interactive lease-term pricing timeline | Frontend UI + backend endpoint generating seasonal pricing matrix |
| 6 | `rent-optimization-ml` | 1.1 — Dynamic Lease Pricing | Seasonal demand incentive algorithm | Extend `RentOptimizationService` with month-demand weighting |
| 7 | `rent-optimization-ml` | 1.1 — Dynamic Lease Pricing | 90-day renewal offer generation | Cron job scanning leases expiring in 90 days, generating `RENEWAL_PRICING_GENERATED` intents |
| 8 | `ai-prescreening` | 2.2 — Fair Housing | Traceability Log (plain English decision explanations) | Add `decisionExplanation` field to application scoring |
| 9 | `ai-prescreening` | 2.2 — Fair Housing | Exclude protected-class proxies from scoring | Pre-sanitization middleware in the scoring pipeline |
| 10 | `ai-prescreening` | 2.3 — Tenancy Risk Scoring | Auto-approve above threshold + auto lease draft | Extend `RentalApplicationService` with threshold-based `ApproveTenantIntent` |
| 11 | `ai-prescreening` | 2.3 — Tenancy Risk Scoring | Continuous learning from eviction/delinquency data | Feedback loop storing actual outcomes vs predicted scores |
| 12 | `contracts` | 1.1 — Smart Escrow | Escrow state tracking (Funded/Held/Disputed/Released) | Extend billing/ledger with escrow state machine |
| 13 | `contracts` | 2.2 — Yield Sweeps | Rule engine for rent bifurcation | Post-payment webhook logic splitting management fees / reserves / owner yield |
| 14 | `backend-services` | 1.2 — Right to be Forgotten | Anonymization API endpoint | New controller + service for GDPR data export/deletion |
| 15 | `backend-services` | 2.1 — Accounting Sync | Anomaly detection on sync data | Extend QuickBooks service with statistical anomaly guards |

### 🟡 Tier 2: Requires External API Stubs (Plaid, Vision, Translation)

These involve third-party APIs that we can architect with clean interfaces and local mock/heuristic implementations.

| # | File | Story | Criterion |
|---|------|-------|-----------|
| 16 | `ai-prescreening` | 1.1 — Income Verification | Calculate Average Monthly Net Income from bank txns (Plaid) |
| 17 | `ai-prescreening` | 1.1 — Income Verification | Verified Income Data Card |
| 18 | `ai-prescreening` | 2.1 — Forgery Detection | ML document metadata/forgery scan |
| 19 | `tenant-portal-web` | 1.2 — Maintenance AI | Computer vision for appliance detection |
| 20 | `tenant-portal-web` | 1.2 — Maintenance AI | Self-Fix video suggestions |
| 21 | `rent-optimization-ml` | 2.1 — Market Sentinel | Geofenced comparable scraping |

### 🔴 Tier 3: Mobile-Native / Hardware-Dependent (Out of Scope)

These require React Native, ARKit, BLE hardware, or native mobile SDKs — not buildable in our web stack.

| File | Stories | Count |
|------|---------|-------|
| `tenant-portal-mobile` | All 6 stories (Digital Wallet, AR, Smart Sensors, Voice, Geofencing, Rich Notifications) | **18 criteria** |
| `ai-prescreening` | 1.2 — Biometric Verification (Liveness/Facial Recognition) | **3 criteria** |

